<title>USA: Marsh &amp; McLennan prices offering.</title>
<headline>Marsh &amp; McLennan prices offering.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marsh &amp; McLennan Cos Inc said Monday its secondary offering of 3.09 million shares of common stock by former stockholders and retirees of Johnson &amp; Higgins had been priced at $119 per share.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement Marsh &amp; McLennan would not get any proceeds from the offering by the selling stockholders. Marsh &amp; McLennan Companies completed its acquisition of Johnson &amp; Higgins, an insurance brokerage, on March 27.</p>
<p>J.P. Morgan &amp; Co and Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc are joint lead managers for the offering.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk, (212) 859-1610))</p>
</text>
